OL,3,ATory candidates must sign pledge to
OL,4,Ascrap net-zero targets, says Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll Conservative candidates will have
OL,7,Fto sign a pledge committing themselves
OL,8,Fto leaving the European Convention on
OL,9,FHuman Rights and scrapping net-zero
OL,10,Femission targets ahead of the next
OL,11,Felection, Conservative leader Kemi
OL,12,FBadenoch has said.
OL,14,FUnveiling her "candidates covenant" at
OL,15,Fan event in the East Midlands, Badenoch
OL,16,Fsaid both policies were "necessary for
OL,17,Fa stronger economy and a stronger
OL,18,Fcountry".
OL,20,FThe move could see some senior
OL,21,FConservatives blocked from standing for
OL,22,Fthe party at the next general election.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
