OL,3,ATory candidates must sign pledge to
OL,4,Ascrap net-zero targets, says Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FLord Barwell, a former Conservative
OL,7,Fminister and No 10 chief of staff,
OL,8,Fsaid: "After a summer in which the
OL,9,Fimpacts of climate change were clearer
OL,10,Fthan ever, this is bad policy."
